text = "Everything here sits on a 0.5 m grid: in the editor, Transform > Configure Snap, Translate Snap 0.5, then snap with the magnet button.
Each station is a pad with a name, one scene file in game/zoo/stations/: entities on it are instances of the game's own scenes.
A new station is its own file there plus one instance under Stations in this scene; drag it to place it."

